{"text": "INTEROFFICE MEMORANDUM\n\n\u201cTo: Distribution List \u2018 Date: 11-23-98\nFrom: Buddy Hine Be Ce: G. Baroody\nSubject DIRECT MAIL PRODUCTION GUIDE\n\nDue to the complexity and the increasing importance of direct mail, we have developed a\nLorillard Production Guide that will help facilitate your understanding of direct mail production\nrequirements.\n\nWe have attempted to communicate procediures, responsibilities and accountabilities associated\nwith the production process. Every person that is involved with direct mail should review this\ndocument carefully and follow the guidelines set forth.\n\nAlthough all appropriate Lorillard departments reviewed and had input into these procedures, I\nam quite sure that there is something missing or in error. Additionally, as our projects in direct\nmail become more diverse, the production requirements and our responsibilities change. T am\ncommitted to keeping these procedures current. Please see me now or at anytime in the future\nyou have any modifications or additions to this document.\n\nappreciate the efforts of those that assisted me with the development of this manual. I hope you\nfind it worthwhile.\n\nO2PLIL86",
